<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<br><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[Client]</span>,<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="">It was a pleasure meeting you at our introduction call. You may recall the resources we discussed during the meeting; these are linked below for your review.<br><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://share.articulate.com/9kKBWL5f3ypRx4dJzwYYb">Enrollment Administration Guide</a></span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="http://service.insperity.com/service-technology/ESC5tutorials/INTRO%20VIDEO_2.mp4">Welcome to Insperity Premier (for Administrators) (0:57)</a></span></li></ul></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">This screenshot illustrates the footer of Insperity Premier where numerous resources reside for your quick and convenient reference.<br><br></font><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To ensure Insperity is helping you achieve your business goals, I would like to schedule a service strategy meeting with you to learn more about your company's needs. Together we will design the right service strategy plan that aligns the services we provide to help you achieve those goals.<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Are you available to meet at one of these dates &amp; time in person or virtually?<br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">insert suggested date and time</font></li><li><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">insert suggested date and time</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Feel free to suggest alternate times to meet during the times I’ve proposed, if needed.<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">When we last spoke on <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[insert initial meeting date]</span>, we briefly touched on <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[insert relevant notes from initial meeting]</span>. At this next meeting, we will talk more in-depth about your plans for this year and which resources at Insperity can help you meet your objectives.</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;<br><br></span></div><div style=""><font face="arial">In advance of our meeting y</font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">ou may also wish to begin exploring <a href="https://passport.insperity.com/SecureAuth15/SecureAuth.aspx?wa=wsignin1.0&amp;wtrealm=urn%3asp.PCMS&amp;wctx=rm%3d0%26id%3dpassive%26ru%3d%252fcs%252fnsp%252findex&amp;wct=2024-09-05T17%3a09%3a54Z&amp;wreply=https%3a%2f%2fportal.insperity.com%2fcs%2fnsp%2findex">Insperity Premier</a>; this platform offers the opportunity to manage your employees’ lifecycle, execute payroll, run reports, and houses forms and policies pertinent to your business. You’ll find supportive videos in the Need Help link at the bottom of the page as well as important contact information that mirrors the Client Contact sheet provided before our first meeting.<br>&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">I look forward to our next conversation and thank you for allowing Insperity to serve your business.<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thanks so much,<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div>]]></td>
